{"id":"afb378126cbf5f83","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-ordinal.md","title":"Ordinal (Recursive Ordinal)","display":"df-ordinal — Ordinal (Recursive Ordinal)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-ordinal","aliases":["92-df-ordinal"],"display":"df-ordinal — Ordinal (Recursive Ordinal)","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-set]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal — Ordinal (Recursive Ordinal)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (ordinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\;\\subseteq D^2\">\\(\\prec\\;\\subseteq D^2\\)</span> (recursive presentation domain and relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (pairing function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecSet}\\)</span> (recursive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecOrd}\\)</span> (recursive-ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{otp}\">\\(\\mathrm{otp}\\)</span> (order-type function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecOrd}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\prec\\;\\subseteq D^2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(D)\\land\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(\\{J(m,n)\\mid m,n\\in D,\\ m\\prec n\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m\\in D\\;\\neg(m\\prec m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n,r\\in D\\;((m\\prec n\\land n\\prec r)\\Longrightarrow m\\prec r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n\\in D\\;(m\\neq n\\Longrightarrow(m\\prec n\\lor n\\prec m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;(X\\neq\\emptyset\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in X\\;\\neg(n\\prec m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{otp}(D,\\prec)=\\alpha\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecOrd}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\prec\\;\\subseteq D^2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(D)\\land\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(\\{J(m,n)\\mid m,n\\in D,\\ m\\prec n\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m\\in D\\;\\neg(m\\prec m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n,r\\in D\\;((m\\prec n\\land n\\prec r)\\Longrightarrow m\\prec r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n\\in D\\;(m\\neq n\\Longrightarrow(m\\prec n\\lor n\\prec m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;(X\\neq\\emptyset\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in X\\;\\neg(n\\prec m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{otp}(D,\\prec)=\\alpha\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>序数：良序类型</li>\n<li>递归序数：由自然数的某个递归子集上的递归良序呈现的序数；允许有限递归序数以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，而不强制底集等于整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>：最小无穷序数（自然数的序类型）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon_0\">\\(\\epsilon_0\\)</span>：更大的递归序数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{CK}\">\\(\\omega_1^{CK}\\)</span>：Church-Kleene <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>，最小非递归序数</li>\n<li>递归序数用于迭代Turing跳跃</li>\n<li>超算术层级沿递归序数展开</li>\n<li>一致性强度可用序数度量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (pairing function, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}$ (recursive-set predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec\\;\\subseteq D^2","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{otp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecOrd}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\prec\\;\\subseteq D^2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(D)\\land\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(\\{J(m,n)\\mid m,n\\in D,\\ m\\prec n\\})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall m\\in D\\;\\neg(m\\prec m)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall m,n,r\\in D\\;((m\\prec n\\land n\\prec r)\\Longrightarrow m\\prec r)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall m,n\\in D\\;(m\\neq n\\Longrightarrow(m\\prec n\\lor n\\prec m))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;(X\\neq\\emptyset\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in X\\;\\neg(n\\prec m))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{otp}(D,\\prec)=\\alpha\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1^{CK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1853,"backlinks":[{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"19c8b0267ad22ce9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ (class of ordinals, see [[92-df-ordinal]])"},{"id":"aed464040ce8d4ec","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f$ (total ordinal-valued class function with domain $\\mathrm{Ord}$, see [[92-df-ordinal]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-89","loc